# ── Rewrites (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify) ─────────────────
# Status 200 = REWRITE (URL in the browser stays clean, e.g. /admin/classes)
# Status 301/302 would be a real redirect and show /portals/... in the URL.
# NOTE: targets have NO .html on purpose. Both Cloudflare Pages and Netlify
# redirect any ".html" URL to the extensionless one, so a rewrite whose target
# ends in .html makes the browser jump to /portals/... instead of staying clean.
# Rules are matched in order, first match wins — put explicit rules BEFORE wildcards.

# ── Auth / landing ─────────────────────────────────────────
/                /public/html/login        200
/login           /public/html/login        200
/signup          /public/html/signup       200
/change-password   /public/html/change_password  200
/forgot-password   /public/html/forgot_password  200
/reset-password    /public/reset_password        200

